# SECRETS — never commit. Custody credentials (BitGo access tokens, signer
# material) live in the environment or in root-only files on the host, never in
# the repository. There was no .env rule here before the custody work; a single
# committed token is a loss-of-funds event.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
secrets/
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
